OL,3,GNEWSAMan attempts to run 100 miles
OL,4,Aaround a roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has attempted to run 100 miles
OL,7,F(161km) non-stop around a roundabout to
OL,8,Fraise funds for an accessibility gym.
OL,10,FDave Allan, 44, from Kenton, Newcastle,
OL,11,Fattempted the challenge on Saturday and
OL,12,Fmade it to 80 miles, the equivalent of
OL,13,Fmore than three consecutive marathons,
OL,14,Fbefore he had to stop.
OL,16,FHe said he was still happy to have run
OL,17,Ffurther than he ever had before,
OL,18,Fadding: "You won't find me offering any
OL,19,Fexcuses, I just couldn't do it on the
OL,20,Fday, it was a bridge too far."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
